raceable, year\nover year, against the rivals and the management\ngoals.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Makes every KPI trend and plan change traceable, year\nover year, against the rivals and the management\ngoals.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13}, {"id": "e632_458487550", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1920, "y": 3404.0, "width": 250, "height": 95.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 20544042, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 40061176, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e633_734182866", "type": "text", "x": 1930, "y": 3414.0, "width": 230, "height": 56.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 522572350, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 378555372, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Season by Year; Competition by\nYear; KPI Charts; GLO-BUS\nPlanner", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Season by Year; Competition by\nYear; KPI Charts; GLO-BUS\nPlanner", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13}, {"id": "e634_234339003", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 3425.5, "width": 270, "height": 52, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d3557", "backgroundColor": "#fbf3db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 521183412, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 553915433, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated"